[[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3238225\">4450B11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238046\">3310B48</a></p><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection for the rear active A.B.S.\nsensor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Rear wheel sensor left for ABS</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236651\">K75</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Rear wheel sensor right for ABS</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236657\">K76</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Remove the rear hub cover.</p><p>3. Remove the bevel an undo the wheel hub nut.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018290.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<p>1. Remove the rear wheel hub (1a), complete with bearing and active\nA.B.S. sensor, using the tools (1b) and (1c).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Extractor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.821.134.000</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1c</p></td><td><p>Counter weight</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.821.161.000</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018291.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<p>Remove the bearing outer track,\nas necessary, from the stub axle using a chisel. Wear protective\ngoggles.</p><p>1. Remove the bearing outer race (1a), using the extractor (1b)\nand the clamps (1c).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Extractor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.840.005.200</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1c</p></td><td><p>Clamps</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.840.005.103</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018292.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>1. Fit the rear wheel hub (1a), complete with bearing and active\nA.B.S. sensor, using the tool (1b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Tool for Extracting/Fitting</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.870.665.000</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018293.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<p>Tighten the rear wheel hub\nnut to torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Nut</p></td><td><p>HUB WITH BEARING (WITH INSTRUMENTS)</p></td><td><p>M24</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>30.4 - 33.6</p></td></tr></table></div><p>1. Using a chisel, stake the nut collar twice, as illustrated.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018294.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<p>Fit the rear hub cover.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection for the\nrear active A.B.S. sensor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Rear wheel sensor left for ABS</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236651\">K75</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Rear wheel sensor right for ABS</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236657\">K76</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/3238046\">3310B48</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238225\">4450B11</a></p><p>Check and, if necessary, adjust the wheel\ngeometry \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238218\">4450A40</a>\n                                           .</p>"]]